&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing TikTok Shop at a senior level, ideally across multiple brands or client accounts in an agency, ecommerce or brand-side environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
